            },
            {
                "entry_id": "fd3d3150-15c8-3c80-aedb-995640de980a",
                "word": "analphabet",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "fd45de84-cf92-4c41-8b31-60d13d800ca1",
                        "entry_id": "fd3d3150-15c8-3c80-aedb-995640de980a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "analphabets"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "58e0c621-de02-3612-bf53-dbf21272d906",
                        "entry_id": "fd3d3150-15c8-3c80-aedb-995640de980a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person who does not know the letters of the alphabet; a partly or wholly illiterate person."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d1174aa-ede3-4af9-83ad-8653845b2f88",
                                "sense_id": "58e0c621-de02-3612-bf53-dbf21272d906",
                                "text": "In 1861, out of a total population of 21,777,331, there were no less than 16,999,701 \"analphabetes,\" or persons absolutely unable to read."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b77a893-98a5-4677-8acc-9d192a51c980",
                                "sense_id": "58e0c621-de02-3612-bf53-dbf21272d906",
                                "text": "The governor of a distant province receives a telegram from the Ministry asking how many analphabets (illiterates) there are in his area. Neither he nor his colleagues know what an analphabet is, but as anarchism also begins with 'an' they guess that an analphabet must be a dangerous enemy of the state, and report that they have only one—the schoolmaster."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6298f584-6593-4932-9c58-30aa09ec9a28",
                                "sense_id": "58e0c621-de02-3612-bf53-dbf21272d906",
                                "text": "The Beckettian progression appears occasionally: while Miss Counihan (static) is an omnivorous reader and Murphy (transitional) a strict non-reader, Cooper is an analphabete."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cedc0e85-2fc3-447b-a66f-842e0ab97199",
                                "sense_id": "58e0c621-de02-3612-bf53-dbf21272d906",
                                "text": "As to [Paulo] Freire's methods, we should keep in mind that they were primarily developed to teach adult analphabets their own language, as a part of a 'conscientization' process."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "758146ef-808d-4f7a-83fc-79f3eb2db85e",
                                "sense_id": "58e0c621-de02-3612-bf53-dbf21272d906",
                                "text": "The porter was an analphabete, but together / we found your name, down among the Os, / and there you were, my brave love, / in a loose hospital gown that covered nothing; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f54bc8ea-3997-42c7-b93c-0765225431e1",
                                "sense_id": "58e0c621-de02-3612-bf53-dbf21272d906",
                                "text": "(1) What is the impact of not learning written language on the aphasic semeiology of an analphabet? (2) How do physiological mechanisms relate to the production of language in an analphabet? (3) What relationships, if any, can be discerned between an adult analphabet and the aphasia of a child before learning how to write."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "63965e3e-aab5-4d0e-8882-4eb5272ea1c7",
                        "source_entry_id": "fd3d3150-15c8-3c80-aedb-995640de980a",
                        "source_sense_id": "58e0c621-de02-3612-bf53-dbf21272d906",
                        "source_sense_description": "person who does not know the letters of the alphabet — see also illiterate",
                        "target_lang_word": "analphabète",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "analphabète",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36bec8a2-9bcf-358a-ba84-458668ea39fc",
                                        "entry_id": "fa4e6931-2e60-3955-9de1-0c38e86ed585",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui ne sait ni lire ni écrire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ce5a43a-798e-4447-bae0-fb7c50cfc5cb",
                                                "sense_id": "36bec8a2-9bcf-358a-ba84-458668ea39fc",
                                                "text": "Et la culture d'un peuple analphabète, ce sont ses chansons, ses légendes et ses contes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "350ce1cf-d267-4ae1-a641-0219b4135e2f",
                                                "sense_id": "36bec8a2-9bcf-358a-ba84-458668ea39fc",
                                                "text": "Alors qu’il est analphabète et ne possède pas d’ordinateur, que le représentant du fournisseur, la société X, lui a indiqué qu’il s’engageait pour la création d’un site Internet"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69d8f0cb-09e1-33da-87f4-d73ee9f286bf",
                                        "entry_id": "fa4e6931-2e60-3955-9de1-0c38e86ed585",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ignare, qui ne sait rien."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce0bc385-ebb4-4a16-8f96-92e971e486b1",
                                                "sense_id": "69d8f0cb-09e1-33da-87f4-d73ee9f286bf",
                                                "text": "Analphabète pluridisciplinaire, il s’évertue tout de même à se donner une contenance à la hauteur de sa fortune."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16f3d9df-63dd-4722-9f96-94cdf875dc60",
                                                "sense_id": "69d8f0cb-09e1-33da-87f4-d73ee9f286bf",
                                                "text": "Un idiot, un gros moche, un tas analphabète sur lequel crachent même les boudins."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "analphabète",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a214e346-c5f2-3a8e-a4ee-42bf27477b6f",
                                        "entry_id": "fb3134c6-07e2-340d-9db2-f99a88bb7464",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui ne sait ni lire ni écrire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5abf6ff7-4756-4cf1-8974-4eb12f1b30ae",
                                                "sense_id": "a214e346-c5f2-3a8e-a4ee-42bf27477b6f",
                                                "text": "J’étais un analphabète. Je voulais m’instruire. J’en avais marre de pas lire ni écrire, alors j’ai décidé de venir m’autodidacter à Paris."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e5fdf07-8e55-3786-89a8-d114dd2967c4",
                                        "entry_id": "fb3134c6-07e2-340d-9db2-f99a88bb7464",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ignare, qui ne sait rien."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4d3ed8c4-29b7-45bc-96e6-20cb2a9723bf",
                        "source_entry_id": "fd3d3150-15c8-3c80-aedb-995640de980a",
                        "source_sense_id": "58e0c621-de02-3612-bf53-dbf21272d906",
                        "source_sense_description": "person who does not know the letters of the alphabet — see also illiterate",
                        "target_lang_word": "Analphabet",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Analphabet",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c9062c4c-7d2c-3a2e-90f9-6d3516fe3a53",
                                        "entry_id": "b8457005-6e23-342e-8ee3-02dc942a5876",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "jemand, der nicht lesen und/oder schreiben kann; jemand, der an Analphabetismus leidet"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be5474cd-807d-43e4-a670-ebbb2eee5ece",
                                                "sense_id": "c9062c4c-7d2c-3a2e-90f9-6d3516fe3a53",
                                                "text": "Ich bin ein Legastheniker, kein Analphabet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5253446-165f-4de0-b427-f3e9a8e337ef",
                                                "sense_id": "c9062c4c-7d2c-3a2e-90f9-6d3516fe3a53",
                                                "text": "Die sinkende Alphabetisierungsrate bescherte Deutschland einen Zuwachs an Analphabeten."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a200df8c-6fac-4184-a361-63eeada76823",
                                                "sense_id": "c9062c4c-7d2c-3a2e-90f9-6d3516fe3a53",
                                                "text": "„Ich komme mir vor wie ein Analphabet, nicht ein einziges Wort kann ich entziffern.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ebea014-2e44-4057-9e68-ec9b659f150a",
                                                "sense_id": "c9062c4c-7d2c-3a2e-90f9-6d3516fe3a53",
                                                "text": "„Die bunten Bildergeschichten mit den Sprechblasen wurden als »anspruchslose Hefte für Analphabeten« geschmäht, die zur »Verblödung« und »Gefühlsverrohung« führen würden.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7c130c2-ee71-452d-b947-dd2d7b053c95",
                                                "sense_id": "c9062c4c-7d2c-3a2e-90f9-6d3516fe3a53",
                                                "text": "„Demnach war Santinas Verlobter ein Analphabet, der noch nie in seinem Leben eine Schule besucht hatte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03af65ce-2b04-42bc-b7c2-bc209f1f3693",
                                                "sense_id": "c9062c4c-7d2c-3a2e-90f9-6d3516fe3a53",
                                                "text": "„Die Bauern sind beinahe alle Analphabeten, das sind aber auch viele der großen Fürsten, die sich metallene Petschaften mit ihrer Unterschrift gravieren lassen, sodass sie Dokumente nicht unterzeichnen müssen, sondern nur zu stempeln brauchen und damit verhehlen könnnen, dass sie unfähig sind, ihren eigenen erlauchten Namen zu schreiben.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1ed198ab-d637-4190-80d0-4c149d502977",
                        "source_entry_id": "fd3d3150-15c8-3c80-aedb-995640de980a",
                        "source_sense_id": "58e0c621-de02-3612-bf53-dbf21272d906",
                        "source_sense_description": "person who does not know the letters of the alphabet — see also illiterate",
                        "target_lang_word": "Analphabetin",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Analphabetin",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6bbf41da-2fa1-35f9-8a50-34436ac33f30",
                                        "entry_id": "4f3182d8-5ab1-3155-a594-bd6f17ac987f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "weibliche Person, die nicht lesen und schreiben kann"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1926dbe1-913d-4e70-9965-e48b0677c2f8",
                                                "sense_id": "6bbf41da-2fa1-35f9-8a50-34436ac33f30",
                                                "text": "Silke ist eine Analphabetin und kann deshalb keine Bücher lesen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b09d72d-6a25-48df-8c54-ffdfc0e12ff1",
                                                "sense_id": "6bbf41da-2fa1-35f9-8a50-34436ac33f30",
                                                "text": "Das Bildungsministerium plant die Einrichtung einer Schule für Analphabetinnen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7107775-9b6b-468c-b064-f6c263604677",
                                                "sense_id": "6bbf41da-2fa1-35f9-8a50-34436ac33f30",
                                                "text": "„Als Analphabetin ist sie nach Deutschland gekommen, nie länger zur Schule gegangen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f4ceb0f-ee94-4c29-923d-b0b92df09b29",
                                                "sense_id": "6bbf41da-2fa1-35f9-8a50-34436ac33f30",
                                                "text": "„Beide waren Analphabetinnen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e95f1e98-c49d-4baf-bebf-b0ef03fe2ec4",
                                                "sense_id": "6bbf41da-2fa1-35f9-8a50-34436ac33f30",
                                                "text": "„Nach wie vor sind die Frauen hier besonders benachteiligt, doch die Zahl der Analphabetinnen, die 1991 noch etwa 60 Prozent betrug, ist auf 46 Prozent zurückgegangen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
